    {
      "number": "730",
      "text": "730. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u6570\u7684\u5e73\u65b9\uff1a$\\sqrt{25}$\uff0c$\\sqrt{81}$\uff0c$\\sqrt{2}$\uff0c$\\sqrt{3}$\uff0c$-\\sqrt{4}$\uff0c$\\sqrt{5}$\uff0c$-\\sqrt{6}$\uff0c$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{2}}$\uff0c$-\\sqrt{1.3}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "731",
      "text": "731. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u7684\u503c\uff1a\na) $(\\sqrt{7})^2$\uff1b\nb) $\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}$\uff1b\nc) $(-\\sqrt{26})^2$\uff1b\nd) $-\\sqrt{14}\\cdot\\sqrt{14}$\uff1b\ne) $(3\\sqrt{5})^2$\uff1b\nf) $10\\sqrt{2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}$\uff1b\ng) $(0.5\\sqrt{8})^2$\uff1b\nh) $(-2\\sqrt{15})^2$\uff1b\ni) $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^2$\uff1b\nj) $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{6}}\\right)^2$\uff1b\nk) $\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)^2$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "732",
      "text": "732. \u628a\u7ed9\u5b9a\u7684\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u6570\uff08\u6216\u5f0f\uff09\u5199\u6210\u5e73\u65b9\u7684\u5f62\u5f0f\uff1a\na) $9$\uff1b\nb) $64$\uff1b\nc) $6$\uff1b\nd) $10$\uff1b\ne) $2.5$\uff1b\nf) $0.25$\uff1b\ng) $a$\uff08$a>0$\uff09\uff1b\nh) $4b$\uff08$b>0$\uff09.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "733",
      "text": "733. \u5316\u7b80\uff1a\na) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}}$\uff1b\nb) $-\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{5}}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{10}{3\\sqrt{10}}$\uff1b\nd) $-\\frac{a}{3\\sqrt{a}}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "734",
      "text": "734. \u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u4e24\u4e2a\u5f0f\u5b50\u7684\u5e73\u65b9\u5dee\u7684\u5f62\u5f0f\uff0c\u518d\u5206\u89e3\u56e0\u5f0f\uff1a\na) $x^2-9$\uff1b\nb) $a^2-3$\uff1b\nc) $4a^2-7$\uff1b\nd) $16b^2-11$\uff1b\ne) $c-4$\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d$c>0$\uff1b\nf) $5-a$\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d$a>0$.",
      "figure_ids": []
