    {
      "number": "735",
      "text": "735. \u5316\u7b80\uff1a\na) $\\frac{a^2-4}{a+2}$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{c^2-6}{c-\\sqrt{6}}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{x-2}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{2}}$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{a-b}{\\sqrt{a}-\\sqrt{b}}$.",
